  "title": "Launch day",
  "brief": "The video app launches. Almost everyone watches, 480 requests per second, and one in twenty is an upload to process. Halfway through the first wave a Worker crashes. Use everything you have learned: a load balancer in front of several app servers, a cache so the small database is not asked for the same videos again and again, a queue and Workers that keep the Queue Age under 20 seconds even without one of them.",
